  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>The adidas Mexico Handball Spezial updates a '70s indoor handball classic for everyday wear. A suede upper gives the shoe its signature look and feel, while the gum rubber outsole stays true to its court roots with reliable grip underfoot. Finished with a regular fit and lace closure, this low-profile pair works as an easy lifestyle option with authentic sport heritage.</p><p>adidas Mexico Handball Spezial features:</p><ul><li>Suede upper provides a supple, classic court-inspired finish.</li><li>Gum rubber outsole delivers reliable traction and durable wear.</li><li>Regular fit supports an easy, everyday feel.</li><li>Lace closure allows an adjustable, secure fit.</li><li>Handball-inspired construction carries forward vintage indoor-sport style.</li></ul></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas Mexico Handball Spezial - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Aurora Ivy/Better Scarlet</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>HP3674</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Ca